WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.959
Instructions use clear verbs in a useful order; polite requests say please or could

00:00:04.959 --> 00:00:05.299
you.

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:10.871
Which question seeks another person's view? Answer: What do you think about planting

00:00:10.871 --> 00:00:11.237
trees?

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:16.661
Explain how to plant a seed using three commands, then request help politely.

00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:19.987
Discuss why: The first asks for an opinion.
